{"id": "16-2684-2-2", "zh": "以 tha 结尾的词根", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2685-2-4", "zh": "katha，表示讲说。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2685-5-8", "zh": "katheti、kathayati（讲说）。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2685-9-11", "zh": "讨论法。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2685-12-19", "zh": "sākacchā（讨论）、kathā（言论）、parikathā（解说）、aṭṭhakathā（义注）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2686-2-7", "zh": "其中，“**sākacchati**”是指一起交谈。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2686-8-15", "zh": "借着它来讲说意义，所以叫 aṭṭhakathā（义注）；这里 tth 变成了 ṭṭh。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2687-2-7", "zh": "人们借以阐述意义、随顺文句与义理之词，", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2688-2-7", "zh": "并说明缘起、事由与前后关联的，这就被认为是义注。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2689-2-17", "zh": "“aṭṭhakathā（义注）”和“atthasaṃvaṇṇanā（释义）”没有区别。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2690-2-4", "zh": "pathi，表示行走。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2690-5-8", "zh": "panthenti、panthayanti（他们行走）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2690-9-10", "zh": "pantho（道路）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2690-11-46", "zh": "在 bhū 等词根类中，以 a 结尾列出的“patha，表示行走”，构成的是“pathati、patho”这类不加鼻音 ṃ 的形式；而这里以 i 结尾列出的词根，构成的形式总是带有增加的鼻音 ṃ——应当这样理解。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2691-2-4", "zh": "puttha，表示尊重与不尊重。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2691-5-8", "zh": "puttheti、putthayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2692-2-4", "zh": "muttha，表示聚集。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2692-5-8", "zh": "muttheti、mutthayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2693-2-4", "zh": "vattha，表示折磨。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "16-2693-5-8", "zh": "vattheti、vatthayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2694-2-4", "zh": "putha，表示说话。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2694-5-8", "zh": "potheti、pothayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2694-9-11", "zh": "意思是“讲说”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2695-2-4", "zh": "putha，表示打击。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2695-5-8", "zh": "potheti、pothayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2695-9-12", "zh": "他打了那些男孩之后就走了。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2696-2-4", "zh": "katha，表示组织语句。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2696-5-8", "zh": "katheti、kathayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2696-9-10", "zh": "kathā（言谈）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2697-2-4", "zh": "satha，表示衰弱。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2697-5-8", "zh": "satheti、sathayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2698-2-5", "zh": "attha、pattha，表示乞求。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2698-6-9", "zh": "attheti、atthayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2698-10-11", "zh": "attho（所求）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2698-12-15", "zh": "pattheti、patthayati（希求）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2698-16-17", "zh": "patthanā（愿求）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2698-18-22", "zh": "希求、想要对立，所以叫 paccatthikā（敌人）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2699-2-4", "zh": "thoma，表示称赞。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2699-5-8", "zh": "thometi、thomayati（称赞）。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2699-9-10", "zh": "thomanā（称赞）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2700-2-4", "zh": "kātha，表示伤害。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2700-5-8", "zh": "kātheti、kāthayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2701-2-4", "zh": "satha，表示束缚。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2701-5-8", "zh": "satheti、sathayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2702-2-5", "zh": "santha、gantha，表示编结。", "confidence": 50}
{"id": "16-2702-6-9", "zh": "santheti、santhayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2702-10-13", "zh": "gantheti、ganthayati（编结）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2702-14-15", "zh": "gantho（结、典籍）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2703-2-4", "zh": "以上是以 tha 结尾的词根的各种形式。", "confidence": 85}
